  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Indo-Pacific Healthcare Technologies Reverse Trade Mission Series, through Meridian International Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) series will bring delegates from India, Thailand, and Vietnam to the United States to familiarize them with state-of-the-art U.S. technologies, services, and best practices to improve the safety, efficiency, and sustainability of healthcare infrastructure. The primary focus for the India and Thailand RTMs would be on commercial opportunities for healthcare technologies, while the primary focus area of the Vietnam RTM would be on medical device regulations and management systems.</narrative>
  </description>
